<h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">GOV.UK Static Prototype Kit</h1><p class="govuk-body-l">Build and test service journeys with official GOV.UK components. Publish as static pages, with no application server.</p><h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Your starter service</h2><p class="govuk-body">An editable countryside visit application with saved answers, branching and check your answers.</p><a class="govuk-button govuk-button--start" href="{{ '/example/start/' | url }}">Open the starter journey</a><h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Try a research scenario</h2><p class="govuk-body">These presets contain invented information. Opening a scenario applies its answers once.</p><ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet"><li><a class="govuk-link" href="{{ '/example/start/' | url }}?scenario=eligible-applicant">Eligible applicant</a></li><li><a class="govuk-link" href="{{ '/example/start/' | url }}?scenario=ineligible-applicant">Ineligible applicant</a></li></ul><h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Make it yours</h2><p class="govuk-body">Edit the Nunjucks pages in src/pages, the service settings in src/data/site.yaml and the routes in src/data/journeys.yaml.</p>